---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cancellation policy"
  seoTitle="Cancellation Policy | Paradise Travels"
  description="How cancellations, changes and refunds work for tours, hotels, transport and flights booked through Paradise Travels (Pvt) Ltd in Colombo, Sri Lanka."
  path="/cancellation-policy"
  updated={new Date('2026-10-22')}
  draft
>
  <p>
    Cancellation and refund conditions depend on what you book and when you cancel: hotels, airlines and other suppliers
    each have their own rules, and air tickets follow the fare rules of the ticket. The conditions that apply to your
    trip are set out in your written quote before you pay.
  </p>
  <p>
    If your plans change, tell us as early as possible — the earlier we know, the more options there usually are.
    Contact <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or WhatsApp {SITE.phone}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
